[b] Removed content: [/b]

Chest Removed from Game;

[b] Multiplayer[/b]

The multiplayer mode will only be available when the player wants to activate using the server version which is in a "server" directory within the main game directory. Soon there will be a guide showing how to use a dedicated server with third party programs to play together with 4 friends in a simpler way;

[url=https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=2496809103]Dedicated Server Guide[/url]

All characters saved locally can be used remotely and play with friends this is for everyone and the game automatically loads your statistics and thus also saves both remotely and locally, that is, the game will progress your character both offline and online.

All game content is available in either Single Player or Multiplayer mode so you can progress the game in any mode.

Future updates will extend to both modes;

[b] Save New System[/b]

From this version, an automatic game saving system was created according to the character's slot. Every 30 seconds the game automatically saves your character, this occurs both online and offline.

All players will need to create new characters to suit the news and will be valid for future versions even in the final version, the characters will remain active normally.

Thank you for contacting us about these issues! Thank you for being with me on our Early Access journey!

